<title>USA: Texarkana First to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Texarkana First to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TEXARKANA, Texas 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texarkana First Financial Corp said Monday its board authorized the repurchase of up to five percent of its outstanding common stock, or 89,515 shares.</p>
<p>The plan authorizes open-market purchases over the next 12 months as warranted by market conditions, the company said.</p>
<p>Management believes the current price of common stock does not reflect the company's long-term business and earnings prospects, it said.</p>
</text>
